[N 40-40 Uldaman]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Uldaman at 40: the Badlands leftovers from chapter 35, Hammertoe and Magregan, Theldurin's tablet and Krom's chest in the outer cave, one run through the dungeon (the Lost Dwarves, the Hidden Chamber, Archaedas and the Platinum Discs), then Ryedol, Theldurin, the Ironforge hand-ins and the hearth to Farholde Keep.]
