[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 40: The Platinum Discs (2278, then 2279 and the Thawpelt Sack) can only be accepted at 40, at the Discs behind Archaedas; Uldaman's mobs run 35-47 (Archaedas 47 elite). Still 39? Do the outer cave first, then ride out and hand in Solution to Doom at Theldurin and, if the amulet dropped, Prospect of Faith at Ryedol (the Badlands hand-ins further down: up to 5,500 XP) before you enter the dungeon - with the dungeon's kills that should carry you to 40 before Archaedas. If you are still 39 at the Discs, leave them: no re-run for them
[OC]|cffffffffThelsamar|r  -  you start at Thelsamar where chapter 39d left you; hearth = Farholde Keep and it stays there until the hearth at the end. Required chapter: the Uldaman outer cave and one run of the dungeon, |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r, never a re-run. Nine plain quests, 24,365 XP and 65s (14,495 XP if you are still 39 at the Discs), plus the dungeon kills; the amulet chain and the Shattered Necklace are luck
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r A Sign of Hope (721) and Solution to Doom (709) from chapter 35; The Lost Dwarves (2398) and Reclaimed Treasures (1360) from chapter 39d; Murdaloc (739) only if you were under 38 at the trogg camp in chapter 35. The Riverglades Report (95315) rides on to chapter 40
